  "sourceHash": "eec714c3b9ddf627ce21cfee45ace779ec3bee78a04511390f651e7c7be735e4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_Festival_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发生什么事了？喂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，出了什么事吗？外面是不是有些状况啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请不用担心，目前还没有异常。请您往这边走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉宾已就位，还有2分30秒准备登台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快！把外面的事情处理好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事到如今，赫尔曼你也没有什么威望了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些人都是这几年我发展的手下，他们才知道什么是努力换来的回报和美好的生活！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天就是音乐节的最高峰，我会带上我这么多年应得的所有利益离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还被蒙在鼓里吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我现在就大发慈悲地告诉你，你们看到的火山监测站的数据是错的，很快它就会彻底活性化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石会伴随着爆发蔓延，至少半个城市都逃不过被毁灭的结局！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我什么都不会失去，等到灾难结束我还会回来进行开采。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汐斯塔果然是我的一片宝地！我也深爱着它啊，赫尔曼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_024",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你胆敢说出这样的话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然我是这个城市的天灾信使，那么我当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你们所有人都会被我在此击败，然后眼睁睁地看着汐斯塔变成一片废墟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，最后死在光荣的汐斯塔火山爆发之中。除了我，没有人能把这些秘密带离这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你的野心到此为止了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "做你的美梦！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你也太小看罗德岛了吧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......罗，德，岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_024",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我对你实在太失望了，克洛宁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失望？你说失望？失望的是我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我永远也不会忘记失去了家而不得不睡在垃圾桶中躲避风雨的日子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "财富才是新生活的钥匙，我自那时就明白了这个道理！而你呢？却用我们辛苦得到的钱，去救助那些感染者垃圾！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要把汐斯塔无上的价值葬送在你的伪善之中吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_024",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好好看看你自己，克洛宁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_024",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后，去监狱中思考自己看到了什么吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
